  "coverage": "Selected milestones from 882 through 1991. Earlier extents are approximate; related Rus’ states are distinct. The post-1917 map does not survey civil-war control. Soviet republic ownership and inland paths are reused for the explicit late-Soviet reference frames on the shared detailed atlas land.",
